title: Example - Markdown code block - multi-paragraph
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki;vocab=Markdown

Blank lines inside the fenced body DO NOT terminate the block (fenced blocks ignore the usual paragraph-break terminator — only a matching close fence ends them).

Live:

```
first paragraph

second paragraph after a blank line

third paragraph
```

Source:

````
```
first paragraph

second paragraph after a blank line

third paragraph
```
````

The rendered `<pre>` preserves the blank lines as text content.

